# Secrets for the Deploy to Cloudflare button (see docs/self-hosting.md).
# None are needed: the first person to open a new instance creates its owner.
#
# Optional setup token. When set, first-owner setup also asks for this value,
# and it authorises default-plan integrations. Add it later as a Worker secret
# if you want it; it is commented out so the deploy page does not ask for it.
# HOWMUCH_API_TOKEN=
